## Interface: 16001
## Title: High Fidelity World Map Forever
## Notes: Overlays high-resolution minimap exploration textures onto the world map for a satellite-view experience. Built from World of Warcraft Forever (wow_classic_beta 1.60.1.69913) map data. Type /hfwm to toggle.
